    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the congestion thing, but we checked the traffic logs and the throughput doesn't seem to spike enough to explain 15% loss. it's like something is just hitting the interface for a few seconds then disappearing. could it be an intermittent electrical issue or something in the hardware itself causing these tiny bursts of errors?",
